inst/extdata/rules.rds
----------------------
756 conformance rule definitions - the check logic, scope, messages, cited
guidance and conformance-rule identifiers - extracted at build time from a
pinned commit of cdisc-org/cdisc-open-rules. The commit is recorded in
data-raw/UPSTREAM_SHA and returned by rules_version().

inst/extdata/library_variables.rds
inst/extdata/sdtm_model_variables.rds
inst/extdata/ct_packages.rds
inst/extdata/sdtm_domain_classes.rds
----------------------------------
CDISC standards metadata - variable names, labels, roles, data types, Core
designations, observation classes and Controlled Terminology package dates.
Extracted at build time from the offline caches that cdisc-org's own rules
engine ships in its repository. No CDISC API is contacted at build or run time.

tests/testthat/fixtures/
------------------------
Test data and expected results published alongside the rules in the same
repository, used to verify coreval's implementation against CDISC's own
reference output.


